{"step_index":165,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:06:37Z","thinking":"**Examining Certificate Handling Logic**\n\nThe code retrieves a certificate query parameter from the URL. Its presence triggers a check that determines if a redirection to a specific dashboard tab is needed, or if the logic is already handled in place. This aims to manage certificate verification upon page load based on the query parameter.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update verifyCredential with auth headers and user context\"","EndLine":"60","Instruction":"\"Add auth headers and user identity to verifyCredential in app.js\"","ReplacementContent":"\"    try {\\n        const token = getAuthToken();\\n        const user = getStoredUser();\\n        const headers = { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' };\\n        if (token) {\\n            headers['Authorization'] = 'Bearer ' + token;\\n        }\\n\\n        const verifierName = user ? (user.fullName || user.username) : 'Authorized Officer';\\n        const verifierOrg = user ? (user.institutionName || (user.role ? user.role.replace('ROLE_', '') : 'Authorized Entity')) : 'Authorized Verifier';\\n\\n        const response = await fetch('/api/v1/verify', {\\n            method: 'POST',\\n            headers: headers,\\n            body: JSON.stringify({\\n                query: query,\\n                verifierName: verifierName,\\n                verifierOrganization: verifierOrg\\n            })\\n        });\\n\\n        const data = await response.json();\\n        displayVerificationResult(data);\"","StartLine":"47","TargetContent":"\"    try {\\n        const response = await fetch('/api/v1/verify', {\\n            method: 'POST',\\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\\n            body: JSON.stringify({\\n                query: query,\\n                verifierName: 'Web Portal Visitor',\\n                verifierOrganization: 'External Inquirer'\\n            })\\n        });\\n\\n        const data = await response.json();\\n        displayVerificationResult(data);\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Madziva\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\qualification-verification-system\\\\src\\\\main\\\\resources\\\\static\\\\js\\\\app.js\"","toolAction":"\"Updating app.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Update verifyCredential with user token and identity\""}}]}
