{"step_index":197,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:09:30Z","content":"The **Instant Credential & Blockchain Lookup** window has been removed from the public welcome page and relocated inside the authenticated portal, accessible to authorized users (Verifiers, Institution Officers, and Administrators) after logging in.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Welcome Page (`index.html`)**:\n   - **Removed Public Verification Window**: Removed the verification input card, demo chips, loading spinner, and result card from the hero section of the landing page.\n   - **Added Authorized Gateway Banner**: Replaced the public lookup form with a secure, role-gated call-to-action explaining that verification is restricted to authorized users, with direct links to sign in (**`Sign In to Verify Credentials ➔`**) and access the dashboard.\n   - **Updated Navigation Links**: Pointed the *\"Verify Credential 🔒\"* navigation link to the authenticated verification console (`/dashboard?tab=verifyTab`).\n\n2. **Authenticated Verification Console (`dashboard.html`)**:\n   - **Dedicated Verification Tab (`🔍 Verify Credential`)**: Moved the complete **Instant Credential & Blockchain Lookup** card into the authenticated dashboard as the primary/default tab.\n   - **Includes Full Verification Experience**:\n     - Certificate / Hash input field with *\"Verify Authenticity\"* action.\n     - Quick Demo Record chips (Sarah Jenkins, David Miller, Marcus Vance, Fake Certificate).\n     - Loading spinner and Consensus Node verification status.\n     - Tamper-evident **SHA-256 Digital Fingerprint** proof box.\n     - **Agentic AI Fraud Risk Assessment** heuristics and explanation.\n   - **Role-Based Access Control**:\n     - Automatically verifies user authentication (`localStorage` session token) upon landing; unauthenticated visitors are redirected to `/login?notice=verify_required`.\n     - For **`ROLE_VERIFIER`** users (e.g. employers and external verifiers), the dashboard defaults directly to the Verification console and hides administrative actions (such as credential issuance and revocation).\n     - For **`ROLE_INSTITUTION`** and **`ROLE_ADMIN`**, the verification tab is readily accessible alongside registry management, blockchain ledger explorer, and telemetry.\n\n3. **Authentication & User Management (`login.html` & `DataInitializer.java`)**:\n   - **New Seed Verifier Account**: Added an accredited verifier account to test verification:\n     - **Username**: `verifier`\n     - **Password**: `Verifier@12345`\n     - **Role**: `ROLE_VERIFIER`\n   - **Quick Demo Fill Chips on Login Page**: Added a quick fill button for the `verifier` account alongside Registrar Officer (`officer`) and Admin (`admin`).\n   - **Restricted Access Notice**: Displays an informational banner when users are redirected because authentication is required for verification.\n\n4. **Routing & Client Scripts (`WebController.java` & `app.js`)**:\n   - Configured `/verify` to redirect to `/dashboard?tab=verifyTab`.\n   - Updated `verifyCredential()` in `app.js` to automatically attach the user's JWT bearer token and accredited user identity to the audit trail.\n   - Updated `verifyFromDashboard()` to switch tabs within the dashboard rather than redirecting back to the welcome page.\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Testing\n- Executed `mvn clean test` across the entire test suite (Checkstyle static analysis, Spring Boot MockMvc integration tests, Blockchain ledger consensus tests, and JaCoCo coverage).\n- **Result**: All **35 tests passed with 0 failures, 0 errors, and 0 Checkstyle violations**."}
